# Handlebars templates. Prettier cannot format these without damaging them, so
# the exclusion is load-bearing rather than a preference. The `angular` parser
# fails outright on `{{!-- … --}}`, the comment form every template's mandated
# licence header uses. Prettier's own Handlebars parser, `glimmer`, does parse
# them, but rewrites that header to `{{! … }}` — a form that cannot contain
# `}}`, so it is a semantic downgrade applied silently to all 103 templates.
# Formatting them would mean changing the licence-header convention first.
**/*.hbs

# Regenerated by `npx changeset version` on every release (see the Release
# workflow), assembled from the `.changeset/*.md` bodies — not hand-edited.
# Prettier's output would re-drift on the next release, and because changesets
# indents each wrapped body into a list item, reformatting reflows continuation
# lines out of their bullet rather than tidying them. Leave it unmanaged.
CHANGELOG.md

# Auto-generated by `npm run build:icons` (utils/build-icon-font.mjs); a compact
